  "title": "writecap: Fix linkage on MSYS2",
  "description": "MSYS2 has difficulty figuring out that it needs to link in\nws_cwstream_write when using the static libwritecap after\ncommit 40b552fee6cc9f2ed11d42ed43ca313343d7c9d8, even when\nlinking udpdump against wustil. Probably some kind of\ndllimport nonsense. (It doesn't have a problem with dumpcap,\nwhich links against the static wsutil.)\n\nhttps://github.com/wireshark/wireshark/actions/runs/18686056163/job/53278883781\n\nThis doesn't change the output libraries or binaries on\nLinux or with MSVC.",
